<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰπείν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lowering</i>, of a movement in dancing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				815a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lessening</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔξησις</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				689a25
			</span></i>; <i>reduction</i> of a swelling, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.816
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>humiliation, abasement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.51
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.33.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. καὶ δουλεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεώς τινων ποιεῖν -σιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					11.87
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arist.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγέννεια καὶ τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1457.4
			</span></i>; <i>low estate, low condition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				29.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				1.48
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>lowness of style</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.7a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				8.3.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>dejection</i> of a planet (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταπείνωμα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Doroth.
				86
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
